SUMMARY:FG 2027 · Extended main and special-session abstract deadline
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Conference on Automatic Face and Gesture Rec
 ognition\nMeeting: 2027-04-26 to 2027-04-30\, Marrakesh\, Morocco\nStatus
 : confirmed\, checked 2026-10-30\nFormat: Long and short papers / face\, 
 gesture\, and body recognition\nOfficial source: https://fg2027.ieee-biom
 etrics.org/dates/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#fg
 -2027\nNotes: Official CFP and dates pages\, rechecked 2026-10-30\, keep 
 the abstract and paper deadlines extended to October 23 and 30 (from Octo
 ber 9 and 16)\; cutoffs are AoE. Workshop and tutorial proposals were ext
 ended from October 20 to November 14\, with notification moved to Novembe
 r 18. The full event includes April 26/30 workshops\; main sessions are A
 pril 27-29. Demo (January 4)\, Doctoral Consortium (February 15) and comp
 etition steps are not tracked. CMT opening was announced for September 25
  without an exact hour\; no portal-open observation is fabricated. M is a
 n editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Biometrics & Human Sensing,Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition
 ,Deep Representation Learning,Machine Learning
URL:https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/dates/
