 l source: https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers\nVenue R
 adar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#cvpr-2027\nNotes: Official 2
 027 homepage\, CFP and Dates page\, rechecked 2026-10-30\, confirm Seattl
 e and fixed AoE dates with no extension\; the Call for Workshops states t
 hat CVPR 2027 is in person. The mandatory Nov 10 paper registration gates
  paper submission: no new submissions and no author additions or removals
  after it. OpenReview's public submission invitation\, open to all users 
 since Oct 27 and due Nov 10 AoE\, was live on 2026-10-30. XXL is supporte
 d by the organizer's description of more than 10\,000 annual attendees. H
 istorical acceptance statistics refer to the main technical program\, not
  workshops.
CATEGORIES:Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition,Deep Representation Learni
 ng,Machine Learning
URL:https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers
